OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash over UK
OL,4,Agovernment borrowing and North Sea
OL,5,Adrilling approval
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham and Kemi Badenoch clash
OL,8,Fover oil and gas licences, and public
OL,9,Ffinances, at Prime Minister's Questions
OL,10,F- recap of the back and forth
OL,12,FBadenoch began by asking Burnham if the
OL,13,Fgovernment would overturn Labour's
OL,14,Fmanifesto commitment not to grant new
OL,15,Ffossil fuel licences
OL,17,FEarlier, the government announced it
OL,18,Fwas approving drilling in the Jackdaw
OL,19,Fgas field in the North Sea - where a
OL,20,Flicence was granted in 2022, before
OL,21,Fbeing delayed in the courts
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
