OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash over UK
OL,4,Agovernment borrowing and North Sea
OL,5,Adrilling approval
OL,6,
OL,7,FAccusing Burnham of "dithering" over
OL,8,Fthe decision, the PM says his
OL,9,Fgovernment fixed what the Conservatives
OL,10,Fhad "messed up"
OL,12,FBadenoch also presses Burnham on UK
OL,13,Fpublic sector debt, which has passed
OL,14,F#3tn, calling on the PM to cut the
OL,15,Fwelfare bill
OL,17,FThe prime minister cites the IMF, which
OL,18,Frecently praised the UK's efforts to
OL,19,Freduce the deficit, and questions how
OL,20,Fthe Conservatives have the "audacity"
OL,21,Fto "lecture us about how to do a
OL,22,FBudget"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
